    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.75 Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of December 15, 2006\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 15th December, 2006]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nJAPAN - SRI LANKA EDUCATIONAL ANDCULTURAL ASSOCIATION(INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 52 OF 2006\n\nJapan - Sri Lanka Educational and Cultural Association (Incorporation) Act, No. 52 of 20061\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof the Japan -Sri LankaEducationaland CulturalAssociation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n[Certified on 15th December 2006]\n\nL. D. O.INC-11/2003\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE JAPAN - SRI LANKA EDUCATIONAL ANDCULTURAL ASSOCIATION\n\nWHEREAS an association called and known as the \u201cJapan-Sri Lanka Educational and Cultural Association\u201d hasheretofore been established in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Association according to the rulesagreed to by its members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Japan - Sri LankaEducational and Cultural Association (Incorporation) Act,No. 52 of 2006."
  },
