    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nVALUE ADDED TAX (AMENDMENT)ACT, NO. 49 OF 2006\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 15th December, 2006]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs.Postage : Rs.\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of December 15, 2006\n\n1Value Added Tax (Amendment)Act, No. 49 of 2006\n\nShort title.\n\n2\u2014PL001649\u2013450 (12/2006)\n\n[Certified on 15th December, 2006]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 78/2006.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE VALUE ADDED TAX ACT, NO. 14 OF 2002\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.(1) This Act may be cited as the Value Added Tax(Amendment) Act, No. 49 of 2006.\n\n(2) The provisions of this Act shall for all purposes bedeemed to have come into operation on November 17, 2006.\n\n2.Section 6 of the Value Added Tax Act, No. 14 of 2002(as last amended by Act, No. 8 of 2006) is hereby amended bythe substitution for the words \u201cseven percentum ; and\u201d of thewords, \u201cten percentum ; and\u201d.\n\n3.In the case of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendment ofsection 6 of Act,No. 14 of 2002.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, NO. 32,TRANSWORKS HOUSE, LOTUS ROAD, COLOMBO 01 before 15th December each year in respectof the year following."
