    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 5.50 Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of September 29, 2006\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 26th September, 2006]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nNATIONAL KIDNEY FOUNDATION OFSRI LANKA (INCORPORATION)ACT, No. 34 OF 2006\n\nNational Kidney Foundation of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No. 34 of 20061\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 26th September, 2006]\n\nL. D. \u2014O. Inc. 32/2005\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE NATIONAL KIDNEY FOUNDATION OFSRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS a foundation called and known as the \u201cNationalKidney Foundation of Sri Lanka\u201d has heretofore been formedfor the purpose of effectually carrying out and transacting allobjects and matters connected with the said Foundationaccording to the rules agreed to by its members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated, and it will be for the public advantage togrant such application.\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the National KidneyFoundation of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No. 34 of 2006"
  },
