    "chunk_text": "(a)for the words \u201cSri Lanka Institute of AdvancedTechnical Education\u201d of the words \u201cSri LankaInstitute of Advanced Technological Education\u201d;\n\n(b)for the words \u201cAdvanced Technical Institute\u201d or\u201cAdvanced Technical Institutes\u201d of the words\u201cAdvanced Technological Institute\u201d or \u201cAdvancedTechnological Institutes\u201d as the case may be.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendment ofthe Long Title ofthe Act, No. 29of 1995.\n\n\u201cSri LankaInstitute ofAdvancedTechnicalEducation\u201d and\u201cAdvancedTechnicalInstitute\u201d to beknown as \u201cSriLanka Instituteof AdvancedTechnologicalEducation\u201d and\u201cAdvancedTechnologicalInstitute\u201drespectively.\n\nSri Lanka Institute of Advanced TechnicalEducation (Amendment) Act, No. 25 of 20062\n\nInstitute of Advanced Technological Education\u201d and\u201cAdvanced Technological Institute\u201d or \u201cAdvancedTechnological Instituties\u201d as the case may be.\n\n4.The principal enactment is hereby amended by thesubstitution for the expression \u201ctechnical\u201d of the expression\u201ctechnological\u201d wherever that expression occurs in theprincipal enactment.\n\n5.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nSubstitution forthe expression\u201ctechnical\u201d of,the expression\u201ctechnological\u201d.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseof anyinconsistency.\n\n3Sri Lanka Institute of Advanced TechnicalEducation (Amendment) Act, No. 25 of 2006\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNM ENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, NO. 32, TRANSWORKSHOUSE, LOTUS ROAD, COLOMBO 01 before 15th December each year in respect of the year following."
